{{Quote|They said I could go home. I just wanna go home.|Jax|<ref name="Identity Crisis" />}}
'''Jax''' was a [[Youngling|young]]<ref name="Identity Crisis" /> [[Gender|male]]<ref name="Identity Crisis AD" /> [[Mirialan]] who was kept as a [[prisoner]] in [[Tantiss vault|the vault]] of [[Tantiss Base]], where he was designated '''SP-32'''. He, along with two other children named [[Eva]] and [[Sami (Pantoran)|Sami]], were imprisoned due to their high [[Midi-chlorian|M-count]]. At one point, he tried and failed to escape, resulting in him getting [[stun]]ned and being put in isolation for two [[Local day|rotations]].<ref name="Identity Crisis" /> He and the other children would eventually escape Tantiss with the aid of Doctor Karr and the [[Clone Force 99|Bad Batch]].<ref name="Cavalry Has Arrived">{{TBB|The Cavalry Has Arrived}}</ref>

